  "description": "The META POWER SX AVINOX SIGNATURE offers a premium configuration for aggressive e-enduro riding.\n• The FOX 36 Factory in 160 mm paired with the FOX Float X Factory shock absorber offers a perfect balance between sensitivity, support, and dynamism, for maximum grip and control.\n• SHIMANO XT 4-piston braking with GALFER Shark 203/203 mm discs guarantees power, endurance, and precision.\n• DT SWISS HX1700 wheels mounted on DT SWISS 350 hubs and Hybrid 1 spokes ensure robustness and quick engagement. The hubs feature the DEG DF (Degrees of Freedom) system, adjustable to 0° or 10°: an anti-kickback device that decouples the drivetrain from the suspension for greater freedom of movement and reduced pedal kickback.\n• The SRAM GX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain, combined with the E13 Helix Race 155 mm crankset, offers fast and reliable gear changes.",
